## Merge conflicts

```bash
# See which files conflict
git status

# After editing conflicted files (remove ALL <<<, ===, >>> markers):
git add <resolved-file>
git commit -m "fix: resolve merge conflict in axi scoreboard"   # after merge
git rebase --continue                                            # after rebase

# Abort and start over
git merge --abort
git rebase --abort

# Quick scan to confirm no markers remain
grep -rn "<<<<<<" tb/

# Launch visual merge tool
git mergetool
```

**Conflict marker anatomy:**
```
<<<<<<< HEAD          ← your changes start here
  your version
=======               ← divider
  incoming version
>>>>>>> branch-name   ← incoming changes end here
```

