## Commit message format

```
type(scope): short description (≤72 chars)
```

| Type        | When to use                          |
|-------------|--------------------------------------|
| `feat`      | New test, sequence, or feature       |
| `fix`       | Bug fix                              |
| `cov`       | Coverage work                        |
| `refactor`  | Cleanup with no behaviour change     |
| `chore`     | Build, CI, config changes            |
| `docs`      | Documentation only                   |

